  "title": "Finding Strength in the “Giant Family” of the FA Community",
  "summary": "Kailey, who lives in Louisiana with her boyfriend and two dogs, was diagnosed with Friedreich’s ataxia (FA) after years of concerning symptoms and multiple kinds of testing. She describes FA as feeling like your brain and body aren’t communicating. Despite the challenges of living with FA, she finds strength in the FA community and admires…",
